            </note>
            <note corresp="#d694-f3" n="22" xml:id="d694-f3-content">
                <p>Signed at Washington February 23, 1942; for text, see Department of State
                    Executive Agreement Series No. 241, or 56 Stat. (pt. 2) 1433; for correspondence
                    regarding negotiation of this agreement, see <ref target="frus1942v01#pg_525">
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Foreign Relations</hi>, 1942, vol. <hi
                            rendition="#small-caps">i</hi>, pp. 525</ref> ff.</p>
            </note>
